\par\par \b \uc2 Musk's \uc2 xAI\uc2  Startup Reorganizes As Some Co-Founders, Others Exit\b0\par\par\uc2 By Georgia Wells and Katherine Blunt \par \uc2 341 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 February 2026\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal\par \uc2 J\par B2\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2026 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2  announced a reorganization of \uc2 xAI\uc2 , his artificial-intelligence startup, days after merging it with \uc2 SpaceX\uc2 , his rockets-and-satellites business.\par \par \uc2 During a company all-hands meeting Wednesday, Musk confirmed that the reorganization would involve the departure of some employees and said it was made necessary by \uc2 xAI\uc2 's rapid growth.\par \par \uc2 "As you grow a company, a natural thing that happens is you reorganize the company as it scales up," he said at the meeting, video of which the company posted to its X social-media app. "Because we reached a certain scale, we're organizing the company to be more effective at this scale."\par \par \uc2 He said the people departing were "better suited to the early stages" of \uc2 xAI\uc2 's development.\par \par \uc2 Two of \uc2 xAI\uc2 's co-founders, Jimmy Ba and Yuhuai (Tony) Wu, confirmed in X posts that they were among those leaving. "Grateful to have helped cofound at the start," Ba wrote.\par \par \uc2 "It's time for my next chapter," Wu wrote.\par \par \uc2 Musk has told people he intends to take \uc2 SpaceX\uc2  public by July.\par \par \uc2 In the all-hands meeting, Musk unveiled a new organizational structure for \uc2 xAI\uc2  that divides the company into four main teams: one focused on Grok, its AI chatbot; another devoted to a coding-specific AI model; a third working on its image-generation model, and a fourth pursuing a project dubbed Macrohard, aimed at simulating software products with AI.\par \par \uc2 "The Macrohard project over time will probably be our most important project because what we're talking about is emulation of entire human companies," he said.\par \par \uc2 Musk said \uc2 xAI\uc2  was already ahead of competitors in areas including image and video generation, voice-based AI and forecasting, despite forming years or even decades after the other leading AI labs.\par \par \uc2 Employees said in the video that users are now creating close to 50 million videos a day using Imagine, a video-generation and editing tool the company started working on six months ago.\par \par \uc2 Document J000000020260212em2c0001u\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw300\pich40\picscaley125\picscalex125\picwgoal3600\pichgoal480
