\par\par \b \uc2 Nike\uc2  Faces Probe Into Antiwhite Job Bias\b0\par\par\uc2 By Lauren Weber and Katherine Hamilton \par \uc2 252 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 February 2026\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal\par \uc2 J\par B3\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2026 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 The federal watchdog responsible for fighting workplace discrimination has found a high-profile target in its efforts to eradicate corporate diversity practices: \uc2 Nike\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Equal Employment Opportunity Commission\uc2  said Wednesday that it had opened an investigation into whether \uc2 Nike\uc2  discriminated against white workers in hiring, layoffs and other workforce decisions. The agency filed a subpoena enforcement action against \uc2 Nike\uc2  in a federal Missouri court, adding that it had sought information related to the allegations since 2018.\par \par \uc2 Nike\uc2 , which denied the allegations, said it was taken aback by the move.\par \par \uc2 "This feels like a surprising and unusual escalation," a company spokesperson said, adding that it had been cooperating in good faith with the inquiry. "We have shared thousands of pages of information and detailed written responses to the \uc2 EEOC\uc2 's inquiry and are in the process of providing additional information."\par \par \uc2 Nike\uc2  is the biggest company yet to be targeted by the Trump administration for its diversity practices. The Republican chair of the \uc2 EEOC\uc2 , Andrea Lucas, has enthusiastically supported President Trump's efforts to fight what the White House has called "illegal DEI" programs. Last year she opened investigations into the diversity programs of 20 law firms. Lucas took to social media to urge white men to report if they felt they had been harmed by corporate efforts to diversify workforces. Many employers bolstered those efforts after a national reckoning about racism in the wake of George Floyd's murder in 2020.\par \par \uc2 Document J000000020260205em2500012\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw300\pich40\picscaley125\picscalex125\picwgoal3600\pichgoal480
