\par\par \uc2 Technology\par \b \uc2 Pinterest\uc2  to Cut About 700 Jobs --- Social-media platform will reduce office space in its restructuring\b0\par\par\uc2 By Connor Hart \par \uc2 294 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 January 2026\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal\par \uc2 J\par B4\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2026 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Pinterest\uc2  said it would cut up to about 15% of its workforce, or roughly 700 jobs, as part of a restructuring aimed at pivoting resources toward higher-growth areas such as artificial intelligence.\par \par \uc2 The social-media platform on Tuesday said the restructuring will help support its transformation initiatives, including reallocating resources to AI-focused roles and teams, prioritizing AI-powered products, and accelerating the revamp of its sales and go-to-market approach.\par \par \uc2 Pinterest\uc2  makes money through advertising on its platform, and the company has been hurt by a pullback in spending among larger companies.\par \par \uc2 Advertising pricing declined 24% in the third quarter as U.S. retailers navigated "tariff-related margin pressure," Chief Financial Officer \uc2 Julia Donnelly\uc2  said in November.\par \par \uc2 Pinterest\uc2  Shares, which fell 9.6% on Tuesday, have lost roughly 30% of their value over the past year.\par \par \uc2 The weakness in ad pricing prompted the company to turn focus toward AI, as pressure on advertising spending is expected to continue weighing on revenue in the near term. \uc2 Pinterest\uc2  is aiming to boost revenue with long-term investment in AI, focused on helping users find and purchase products in the images they pin.\par \par \uc2 In addition to job cuts, \uc2 Pinterest\uc2  said it will reduce office space in its restructuring. The company forecast after-tax charges of up to $45 million tied to the initiatives, most of which are expected to be cash-related expenditures.\par \par \uc2 Pinterest\uc2  had 4,666 full-time employees as of Dec. 31, 2024, according to the latest head count available in filings with the \uc2 Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The restructuring is projected to be largely complete by the end of September, \uc2 Pinterest\uc2  said.\par \par \uc2 Document J000000020260128em1s0000v\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw300\pich40\picscaley125\picscalex125\picwgoal3600\pichgoal480
